#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:2
msgid "`clash_serve` - Service Management"
msgstr "`clash_serve` - 服务管理"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:4
msgid "A comprehensive utility for Clash service management and configuration."
msgstr "用于 Clash 服务管理与配置的完整工具。"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:6
#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:74
msgid "**Usage**::"
msgstr "使用方法::"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:10
#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:78
msgid "**Available Commands**:"
msgstr "可用命令："

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:11
msgid "``run`` - Start the Clash service manually"
msgstr "``run`` - 手动启动 Clash 服务"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:12
msgid "``config`` - Manage config.yaml file"
msgstr "``config`` - 管理 config.yaml 文件"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:13
msgid "``service`` - Manage Clash as a systemd service"
msgstr "``service`` - 以 systemd 服务方式管理 Clash"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:15
#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:33
#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:61
msgid "**Description**:"
msgstr "说明："

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:16
msgid ""
"This tool provides functions for running Clash manually, managing its "
"configuration, and controlling it as a systemd service."
msgstr "该工具提供手动运行 Clash、管理其配置，并以 systemd 服务方式控制的能力。"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:18
#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:36
#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:64
msgid "**Features**:"
msgstr "特性："

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:19
msgid "Manual service execution"
msgstr "手动运行服务"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:20
msgid "Systemd service management (add, remove, status)"
msgstr "Systemd 服务管理（添加、移除、状态）"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:21
msgid "Configuration file management with editor integration"
msgstr "集成编辑器的配置文件管理"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:24
msgid "Detailed Commands"
msgstr "详细命令"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:27
msgid "run - Start Clash Service Manually"
msgstr "run - 手动启动 Clash 服务"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:29
msgid "Start the Clash service with proper configuration::"
msgstr "以正确配置启动 Clash 服务::"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:34
msgid ""
"This command starts the Clash service by running ``sudo ./clash -d ./`` "
"in the script directory. It is intended for manual, one-off execution. "
"For a persistent background service, use the ``service`` command."
msgstr "该命令通过在脚本目录执行 ``sudo ./clash -d ./`` 启动 Clash，适用于一次性的手动执行。若需常驻后台，请使用 ``service`` 子命令。"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:37
msgid "Automatically changes to the correct directory"
msgstr "自动切换到正确目录"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:38
msgid "Runs Clash with sudo privileges"
msgstr "以 sudo 权限运行 Clash"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:39
msgid "Uses the current directory as the configuration directory"
msgstr "使用当前目录作为配置目录"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:42
msgid "config - Manage Configuration File"
msgstr "config - 管理配置文件"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:44
msgid "Manage the config.yaml file::"
msgstr "管理 config.yaml 文件::"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:48
msgid "**Options**::"
msgstr "选项::"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:53
msgid "**Examples**::"
msgstr "示例::"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:62
msgid ""
"This command helps manage the ``config.yaml`` file. By default, it "
"displays the absolute path of the configuration file. With the ``--edit``"
" option, it opens the file in your default editor."
msgstr "该命令用于管理 ``config.yaml`` 文件。默认显示配置文件的绝对路径，使用 ``--edit`` 选项将用默认编辑器打开。"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:65
msgid "Display configuration file absolute path"
msgstr "显示配置文件绝对路径"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:66
msgid "Open configuration file in editor"
msgstr "在编辑器中打开配置文件"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:67
msgid "Respects ``EDITOR`` environment variable"
msgstr "遵循 ``EDITOR`` 环境变量"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:70
msgid "service - Manage as a Systemd Service"
msgstr "service - 以 Systemd 服务方式管理"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:72
msgid ""
"Manage the clash systemd service for running it in the background "
"persistently. All service commands require ``sudo`` privileges."
msgstr "以 systemd 方式常驻运行 Clash。所有服务相关命令需要 ``sudo`` 权限。"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:79
msgid "``add`` - Install, enable, and start the service"
msgstr "``add`` - 安装、启用并启动服务"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:80
msgid "``remove`` - Stop, disable, and remove the service"
msgstr "``remove`` - 停止、禁用并移除服务"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:81
msgid "``status`` - Check the service status"
msgstr "``status`` - 查看服务状态"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:83
msgid "**service add**"
msgstr "**service add**"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:84
msgid "Installs and starts the Clash service."
msgstr "安装并启动 Clash 服务。"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:90
msgid ""
"This command will: 1. Create a systemd service file at "
"``/etc/systemd/system/clash.service``. 2. Configure the service to run as"
" the current user. 3. Reload the systemd daemon. 4. Enable the service to"
" start on boot. 5. Start the service immediately."
msgstr "该命令将：1）在 ``/etc/systemd/system/clash.service`` 创建服务文件；2）配置服务以当前用户运行；3）重载 systemd；4）设置开机自启；5）立即启动服务。"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:97
msgid "**service remove**"
msgstr "**service remove**"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:98
msgid "Stops and completely removes the Clash service."
msgstr "停止并彻底移除 Clash 服务。"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:104
msgid ""
"This command will: 1. Stop the running Clash service. 2. Disable the "
"service from starting on boot. 3. Remove the systemd service file. 4. "
"Reload the systemd daemon."
msgstr "该命令将：1）停止正在运行的服务；2）禁用开机自启；3）移除 systemd 服务文件；4）重载 systemd。"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:110
msgid "**service status**"
msgstr "**service status**"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:111
msgid "Checks the current status of the Clash service."
msgstr "查看 Clash 服务当前状态。"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:117
msgid ""
"This will display detailed information from ``systemctl``, including "
"whether the service is active, its PID, and recent log entries."
msgstr "将显示来自 ``systemctl`` 的详细信息，包括服务是否活跃、其 PID 与最近日志。"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:120
msgid "Permission Requirements"
msgstr "权限要求"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:122
msgid "``run`` command requires ``sudo`` to start Clash."
msgstr "``run`` 命令需要 ``sudo`` 来启动 Clash。"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:123
msgid ""
"``service`` subcommands (``add``, ``remove``) require ``sudo`` to "
"interact with systemd. The ``status`` command may also require it "
"depending on system configuration."
msgstr "``service`` 子命令（``add``、``remove``）需要 ``sudo`` 与 systemd 交互。``status`` 视系统配置可能也需要。"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:124
msgid ""
"``config`` command does not require special permissions unless the file "
"itself requires it."
msgstr "``config`` 命令无需特殊权限，除非文件本身需要。"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:127
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:129
msgid "**Issue: Permission Denied**"
msgstr "问题：权限不足"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:131
msgid "If you get permission errors when running ``clash_serve``, ensure:"
msgstr "若运行 ``clash_serve`` 报权限错误，请确认："

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:133
msgid "You are using ``sudo`` for ``run`` and ``service`` commands."
msgstr "使用 ``sudo`` 运行 ``run`` 与 ``service`` 命令。"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:134
msgid "The ``clash`` binary is executable: ``chmod +x clash``"
msgstr "``clash`` 可执行：``chmod +x clash``"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:135
msgid "The config file exists in the same directory."
msgstr "配置文件存在于同一目录。"
